WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.910
Stay calm...

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.980
Stay calm!

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.770
Then I shall side with the doctor!

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.290
Fool!

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>I want to be strong...</i>

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:20.760
<i>I've always wanted power to stand
 against the fate that toys with me,</i>

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.470
<i>against the threats I face,</i>

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.870
<i>and I've always fought for it.</i>

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:30.590
Hey, Maria!

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.380
What are you doing?

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:36.640
<i>I've come here... To get the strength...</i>

00:00:39.130 --> 00:00:40.020
<i>...that I desire!</i>

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.340
The Igalima and Shul Shagana

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.960
<b>Episode 7 
Carry on the Shining Light, 
and Stay True to Yourself</b>

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:35.960
have been recovered and repaired!

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:38.710
Their functions have been upgraded,

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.590
and the Ignite Module incorporated.

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.090
And of course...

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.000
The Airgetlám has been revived, as well.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.020
Instead of modifying it,

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.380
I replaced the converter with a new one.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.040
I put in a neuro-pass,

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.730
so you'll be able to equip it.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.790
I'm using Serena's gear again.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.240
I want this shining light to make me stronger!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:02.820
Yes.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.870
With this new power,

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:06.990
you need to go train!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:08.760
Train?

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:14.860
As our next battle with the 
Autoscorers draws near,

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.310
mastering the enhanced Symphogears

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:19.380
and Ignite Modules is a top priority.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.490
We need you to pick up some research results

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.540
from the nearby heretical 
technology lab in Tsukuba.

00:03:25.890 --> 00:03:29.710
You can train your bodies and minds there.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.450
Training's my specialty!

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:33.830
Leave it to me!

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.670
What's this?

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:41.650
It was constructed from the data 
Dr. Nastassja left behind in Frontier.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.000
A ball of light?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.300
Yes.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:48.660
We've named it the "photosphere," 
just to have something to call it.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.490
The real thing is much larger.

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:54.170
This is approximately 1/40,000,000th of its true size.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.190
Just what is the photosphere?

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.800
The research data has been picked up.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:04.410
How's your training going?

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:09.030
It's one tough exercise after another!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.990
I'll contact you later!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.060
You can hear the details then...

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:17.510
Tsubasa-san is taking this seriously.

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:21.780
But this is meant to be recreation,
 to get her to relax...

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.450
Come on! Bring it!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:26.740
Go!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:30.870
Huh?

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.190
Why can't I do it?

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:38.500
I have the knowledge required 
to execute a strong serve...

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:41.830
But when you actually try, 
it's totally different, right?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.990
You don't have to push yourself 
to imitate someone else.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.390
You can hit it from below, like this.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.990
Thank you...

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.820
It's okay if it's a weak hit.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.680
What's important is to stay true 
to yourself when you hit it.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.150
Right! I'll do my best!

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.160
And the next thing I knew, 
it really was training...

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:12.160
Who was it who got so serious 
halfway through the game?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:16.420
I'm glad the sky's clear today.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.420
It's because a typhoon came through yesterday.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.420
It's because of our good karma.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.550
By the way, everyone, are you hungry?

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.850
But this beach is government property...

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:30.440
Without ordinary vacationers,

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.110
naturally, there aren't any stalls selling things...

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:39.200
Loser has to go to the store! 
Rock-paper-scissors!

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:48.030
Tsubasa-san used a weird-looking 
scissors, and she lost!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.700
That isn't weird! Those are cool scissors!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.610
Our slashing weapons...

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.380
We both lost!

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.880
Don't only get your favorite snacks.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.460
Buy something to restore our 
electrolytes and minerals.

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:06.090
You're a celebrity, so wear these.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:10.220
You look like a mom, Maria.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:14.220
<b>Level Apple</b>

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.230
All you got were your favorite snacks, Kiri-chan.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.000
Those are the perks of the job.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.860
Was it the typhoon from yesterday?

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.740
They said the shrine was destroyed, too!

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.240
I never thought I'd get to come

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:42.980
to the beach with everyone.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:45.840
Everyone, is it all right to not be training?

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.650
You're so serious, Elfnein.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:51.720
The Ignite Module is an application of the 
principles that cause you to lose control,

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:54.830
but it's also a dangerous function,

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.720
protected by three levels of safeties.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.600
So you need to practice controlling it!

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.330
Garie?

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:06.040
Have you had enough fun 
making summer memories?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.280
Of course not!

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:16.160
<i>Killiter Ichaival tron.</i>

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:51.900
<i>We're having a big sale on bullets.</i>

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:55.030
<i>And there's no cure for...</i>

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:58.640
<i>Huge discounts on ass-kicking, now dan...</i>

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.290
Maria-san! Get them out of here!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:09.840
<i>If you want to gripe at the world,</i>

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.840
Acting without orders from Carol-chan?

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:13.120
<i>start being more than a mere target.</i>

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.570
Who knows?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:20.320
<i>Gods and Buddhas, I'm through with you.</i>

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:27.680
<i>Even if we've ripped off the scars and 
hidden the wounds (Trust Heart),</i>

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:34.150
<i>can we help, and laugh at, one another?</i>

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:38.230
<i>Be it the polite words I'm not 
used to, or a rain of bullets,</i>

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:37.450
Is that...

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.120
Could that be...

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:40.550
<i>I'll hit you with them both (Trust Heart).</i>

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:40.910
We have to go!

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:45.500
<i>Teach me the strength to protect the smiles</i>

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:43.140
It's dangerous here!

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:46.170
Get the kids somewhere safe!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:52.170
<i>that only clasped hands can create.</i>

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.680
Hell, no!

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:49.170
Why do I have to do that?

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:51.790
Don't worry.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.590
If you don't panic, there's no danger.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.530
<i>The Autoscorer is</i>

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:00.600
<i>getting farther away!</i>

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:05.440
<i>Is she after Maria-san?</i>

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:14.860
I found you, failed wielder.

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:19.100
Now, stop running and...

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:26.500
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:37.260
A silver left arm?

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.640
Maria-san, is that...

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.510
The new Airgetlám!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:45.270
<i>What is true strength?</i>

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.630
<i>I wander in search of the answer.</i>

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:49.570
Don't disappoint me like last time.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:52.570
<i>Is it to be proud? To make a vow? 
I still don't know.</i>

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:58.070
<i>I keep asking the smile in my memories.</i>

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:04.300
<i>I won't forget the heat I still feel in my hand.</i>

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.720
<i>To wander, worry, and suffer...</i>

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:10.290
<i>Ripping out your sins, neither hiding 
nor running from them.</i>

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.000
<i>And in your own true voice,</i>

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.750
<i>question your courage and shoot your resolve.</i>

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.910
<i>The LiNKER I put in for training is working!</i>

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:21.440
<i>That is my holy sword! Raise it high!</i>

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.130
<i>I need to do this now!</i>

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.440
An Autoscorer attack?

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.300
Yes.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.470
The wielders have been divided,

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:26.940
<i>It's okay to be weak... It's okay to cry...</i>

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:26.510
and Maria-san is fighting Galie alone.

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.480
With no practice at all?

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:32.860
<i>If a song that won't ever be 
defeated is within my heart.</i>

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:30.980
The Ignite Module is a double-edged sword.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.860
Don't push yourself too hard!

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:37.290
<i>My destiny, past, sorrows, memories, and love...</i>

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:44.020
<i>I'll hold them tightly now, 
as I struggle and rise.</i>

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:44.020
Oh, no! I might lose!

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:46.500
<i>I have found who I truly I am.</i>

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.790
<i>And I...</i>

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:48.090
Just kidding.

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:59.840
You're strong. But...

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:03.970
Let me hear it...

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:06.470
I'll end the fight with this power!

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.100
Ignite Module! Drawn Blade!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:12.350
Dáinsleif.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.520
I need to kill my weak self...

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:38.300
Oh, dear.

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:47.350
She's only a rabid beast now.

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:50.430
Has she gone out of control?

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.350
The sword's curse swallowed her up!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.780
No, no, not this wild flailing.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.370
Sing, President of Idols!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:15.790
Maria-san!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:23.690
Don't think getting strong is that easy.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.620
I'm disappointed in this failed wielder.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:35.070
Hey, wake up!

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:36.690
Maria-san! Maria-san!

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.030
I couldn't win...

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:46.130
What was it I lost to?

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.880
You were rather flashy.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:58.420
While accomplishing my goal, 
I took a little side trip.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:02.420
Seems she's upset that she was the only one 
who couldn't destroy a pendant.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:03.660
Shut up!

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:07.500
That's why I decided I'd be the first 
to rip it from that failed wielder!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:10.480
You really do try hard.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.310
I need to start taking action soon.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:18.070
I won't let you be the first.

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:24.450
The dolls attack, even after 
having lost their master...

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.070
Why do they continue to withdraw, 
rather than finishing us,

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:30.300
even after the fight has gone their way.

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.230
Come to think of it...

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:34.000
That's a good point!

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.750
It's as if they don't know when 
they can win a fight.

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:40.030
I'm worried about Maria-san, too...

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.260
When the power takes over,

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.260
everything inside your head turns black,

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.960
and you know nothing anymore.

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:55.060
<i>To have my life spared by a doll... Pathetic.</i>

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:59.610
<i>I was unable to resist the sword's 
curse because I'm weak...</i>

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.740
<i>I want to be strong.</i>

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:10.700
I'm sorry.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.670
I was trying not to bother everyone.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.370
You aren't bothering me at all.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:18.560
I'll help you practice.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.580
Okay!

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.470
Go!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.380
This is strange...

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:30.370
It isn't working, after all.

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:34.520
You know a lot of things, Elfnein, 
so maybe you know...

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:37.880
If you do, please tell me.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.770
What does it mean to be strong?

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:44.340
Isn't that

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:47.280
what you taught me?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.030
I'm back, failed wielder.

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:56.450
Maria-san...

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:02.460
This time, you'll sing for me, right?

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.550
It's okay!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.390
You can do it!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.680
If you aren't a failure,

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.310
show me you can fight!

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:07.480
Alca-Noise signal detected!

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.860
Maria and Elfnein are in trouble!

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.020
The wind?

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:22.300
Is something wrong?

00:16:22.630 --> 00:16:24.640
No, it's fine.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.380
I'm sure.

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:42.820
<i>Strong...</i>

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.900
<i>I have to be strong!</i>

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:47.060
Maria-san!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:50.200
Strong...

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.160
Too weak.

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:02.160
You're weak. Can't you use that power?

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:05.700
I'm still weak...

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:08.790
How can I be strong?

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:10.560
Isn't that

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.040
what you taught me?

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:15.850
I...

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.850
Maria-san, what's important 
is being true to yourself.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:22.170
It's okay if it's a weak hit.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:24.980
What's important is to stay true to yourself.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:30.480
Weak... That's right.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.120
I couldn't become strong,

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.490
and then Elfnein made me realize...

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:39.460
Even if I'm weak, I'll stay true to myself.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.620
That is strength.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.670
Elfnein can't fight,

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.910
but she acted with courage, 
without regard for the danger,

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:50.380
to bring us hope.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.410
Elfnein...

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.380
I want you to stand there and listen.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:58.510
This song is my answer to your courage.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.140
Ignite Module! Drawn Blade!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:04.390
Dáinsleif.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.760
<i>Each time I've gotten scared so far,</i>

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.320
<i>I've clung to a lie.</i>

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:20.810
That's right.

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:23.370
If being strong is being true to myself...

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:25.950
Maria-san!

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.520
I'll stay weak,

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:32.380
and beat this curse, regardless!

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:52.310
<i>Putting my love into my silver left arm,</i>

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.470
Weakness is strength?

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:59.860
<i>I rip apart the darkness, cut through 
evil, and become invincible.</i>

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.320
You think that's clever or something?

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:04.180
<i>Piercing through a tiny part of the world,</i>

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:04.700
That's great!

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:06.630
<i>I reveal myself in all my weakness.</i>

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:09.120
<i>Even if the day comes when I fall to my knees,</i>

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:12.040
<i>my heart and my dreams</i>

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:15.580
<i>will never touch the ground.</i>

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.210
<i>Never!</i>

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.950
I'm going to be the first!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:24.810
<i>It's okay to be weak. 
It's okay if your fists aren't strong.</i>

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:30.940
<i>You must punch anyway, 
if your hands remember.</i>

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:34.930
<i>My frustration, my shame, everything...</i>

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:41.160
<i>I'll hold them tightly now, as I become a flame.</i>

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.490
<i>Even if this miracle is covered in mud.</i>

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.200
I'm going to be the first!

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:48.930
<i>Heaven is still watching me.</i>

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:52.690
Maria-san!

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.320
You defeated an Autoscorer?

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:59.760
Somehow...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.900
This is your strength, Maria-san.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.800
It may be weakness,

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:08.640
but that power is what allows me
 to stay true to myself.

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.570
Thank you for telling me how to do it.

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:12.820
Sure.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.060
Excellent work, Garie.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:22.280
I successfully completed my objective.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.860
Next, we'll light a big one!

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.990
I'm glad Maria cheered up.

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.100
Now we can feel good, as we return to Tokyo.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.150
Huh?

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:59.530
Yes, it was a very productive training session.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:01.320
Are you serious?

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.280
Of course it was productive!

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.770
Doesn't it make you hungry?

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:07.950
You're always hungry, aren't you?

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.580
Which means there's only one thing to do!

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:14.200
Loser has to go to the store! 
Rock-paper-scissors!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.840
Paper? That's just like you.

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.730
I thought everyone else would use a fist...

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.840
Fine... I'll go with you.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:25.320
Really?

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:27.810
It's hard to carry everything alone, right?

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:29.800
Thank you!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:31.900
But it's dangerous to run.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.730
<b>Level Apple</b>

00:21:37.990 --> 00:21:40.020
What are you doing?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:41.720
Look at this, Miku.

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:44.640
They have mushroom juice! 
You never see that in Tokyo!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:47.490
And salted onions with natto?

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:49.670
Anglerfish-flavored juice?

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:52.080
Huh? Aren't you...

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.620
Miku-chan, right?

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.910
You know, you used to play with my kid...

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:01.630
What is it, Miku?

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.260
Hibiki...

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:08.860
Dad?

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:14.890
Hibiki!
